```

The active Firebase browser and Functions runtime must have zero dependency on them.

## Service Worker

Verify that the service worker does not cache:

```text
Firebase ID tokens
Authorization headers
authenticated API responses
private Firestore data
```

Ensure the cutover cache version cannot keep old Cloud Run-era application JavaScript indefinitely.

