```text
trees
persons
relationships
photos
other protected data
```

Security failure blocks completion.

## Production Network Inspection

Inspect browser Network traffic during normal use.

Required:

```text
requests to Render = 0

requests to old lineage-api Cloud Run = 0
```

Firebase requests are expected.

Also inspect the browser Console.

Target:

```text
first-party application errors = 0
```

Ignore browser-extension errors only after confirming that they originate from extensions.

